"""Activation of layers.1 MLP down_proj component 4307, a sparse, mostly context-driven feature.
Rules: (1) the host label right after '://' when it is a service/subdomain word
(api, docs, doc, img, raw, json, code, doi) is strongly positive; (2) runs of
leader dots / box-drawing bars (··, ⎯) are negative; everything else is 0."""
READS = ()
SERVICE = {"api", "docs", "doc", "img", "raw", "json", "code", "doi"}
LEADERS = {"··", "⎯"}
def step(carry, prefix, upstream):
